        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> me </STYLE>
        <gr str="3605">all </gr>the <gr str="3117">day</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="4"> My <gr str="1320">flesh </gr>and my <gr str="5785">skin </gr>hath he made <gr str="1086">old</gr>; he hath <gr str="7665">broken </gr>my <gr str="6106">bones</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="5"> He hath <gr str="1129">built </gr>
        <gr str="5921">against </gr>me, and <gr str="5362">compassed </gr>
