      <VERS vnumber="28"> He <gr str="3427">sitteth </gr>
        <gr str="910">alone </gr>and keepeth <gr str="1826">silence</gr>, <gr str="3588">because </gr>he hath <gr str="5190">borne </gr>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> it </STYLE>
        <gr str="5921">upon </gr>him. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="29"> He <gr str="5414">putteth </gr>his <gr str="6310">mouth </gr>in the <gr str="6083">dust</gr>; if so <gr str="194">be </gr>there may <gr str="3426">be </gr>
