        <gr str="410">God </gr>in the <gr str="8064">heavens</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="42">
        <gr str="5168">We </gr>have <gr str="6586">transgressed </gr>and have <gr str="4784">rebelled</gr>: <gr str="859">thou </gr>hast <gr str="3808">not </gr>
        <gr str="5545">pardoned</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="43"> Thou hast <gr str="5526">covered </gr>with <gr str="639">anger</gr>, and <gr str="7291">persecuted </gr>us: thou hast <gr str="2026">slain</gr>, thou hast <gr str="3808">not </gr>
        <gr str="2550">pitied</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="44"> Thou hast <gr str="5526">covered </gr>thyself with a <gr str="6051">cloud</gr>, that <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> our </STYLE>
