      <VERS vnumber="45"> Thou hast <gr str="7760">made </gr>us <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> as </STYLE> the <gr str="5501">offscouring </gr>and <gr str="3973">refuse </gr>in the <gr str="7130">midst </gr>of the <gr str="5971">people</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="46">
        <gr str="3605">All </gr>our <gr str="341">enemies </gr>have <gr str="6475">opened </gr>their <gr str="6310">mouths </gr>
