      <VERS vnumber="52"> Mine <gr str="341">enemies </gr>chased me <gr str="6679 6679">sore</gr>, like a <gr str="6833">bird</gr>, without <gr str="2600">cause</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="53"> They have cut <gr str="6789">off </gr>my <gr str="2416">life </gr>in the <gr str="953">dungeon</gr>, and <gr str="3034">cast </gr>a <gr str="68">stone </gr>upon me. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="54">
