        <gr str="6687">flowed </gr>
        <gr str="5921">over </gr>mine <gr str="7218">head</gr>; <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> then </STYLE> I <gr str="559">said</gr>, I am cut <gr str="1504">off</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="55"> I called <gr str="7121">upon </gr>thy <gr str="8034">name</gr>, O <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, out of the low <gr str="4480 953 8482">dungeon</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="56"> Thou hast <gr str="8085">heard </gr>my <gr str="6963">voice</gr>: <gr str="5956">hide </gr>
